+# Plervo Write
 
-<h1 align="center">WordCraft</h1>
+An experimental member of Plervo Suite by AlporT.
 
-<p align="center">
-  <b>Writing and document design; an open-source, clean-room reimplementation of Microsoft Word, rebuilt in pure Rust.</b>
